{"id":55866,"mal_id":55866,"title":"Yubisaki to Renren","englishTitle":"A Sign of Affection","title_english":"A Sign of Affection","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"A Sign of Affection","ja":"ゆびさきと恋々"},"synopsis":"For hearing-impaired university student Yuki Itose, silence has been a natural part of life since birth. Her world is small and isolated; she commutes to campus, interacts with her best friend Rin Fujishiro, and communicates through writing and text messages—a lifestyle that offers little to no change. One day, during her commute, Yuki meets fellow student Itsuomi Nagi, a multilingual travel enthusiast and friend of Rin. When Itsuomi learns of Yuki's condition, he takes it in stride, moving Yuki's heart. From this one simple gesture, Yuki and Itsuomi's lives start changing day by day as they let each other into their own worlds.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Para Yuki Itose, estudiante universitario con discapacidad auditiva, el silencio ha sido una parte natural de la vida desde su nacimiento. Su mundo es pequeño y aislado; viaja al campus, interactúa con su mejor amiga Rin Fujishiro y se comunica mediante escritura y mensajes de texto, un estilo de vida que ofrece pocos o ningún cambio. Un día, durante su viaje, Yuki conoce a su compañera de estudios Itsuomi Nagi, una entusiasta de los viajes multilingüe y amiga de Rin. Cuando Itsuomi se entera de la condición de Yuki, lo toma con calma, conmoviendo el corazón de Yuki. A partir de este simple gesto, las vidas de Yuki e Itsuomi comienzan a cambiar día a día a medida que se dejan entrar mutuamente en sus propios mundos.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1420,"average_episode_duration":1420,"startDate":"2024-01-06","start_date":"2024-01-06","endDate":"2024-03-23","end_date":"2024-03-23","season":"winter","year":2024,"start_season":{"year":2024,"season":"winter"},"episodes":12,"num_episodes":12,"score":